      "versionNonce": 893726904,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1730000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "VS CODE EXTENSION COMPARISON\n\nalis-build extension exposes the exact same steps 1-5 (bootstrap.*,\nworktrees.*, createVersion, scm.merge) calling the identical BlocksService RPCs.\nNo extra capability found there that alis-hub-v3 is missing.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 52,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "VS CODE EXTENSION COMPARISON\n\nalis-build extension exposes the exact same steps 1-5 (bootstrap.*,\nworktrees.*, createVersion, scm.merge) calling the identical BlocksService RPCs.\nNo extra capability found there that alis-hub-v3 is missing.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
